# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source data and model artefacts. 94 GB of Sentinel-2 patches, 14 GB of
# embedding parquets and 15 GB of checkpoints do not belong in a git history.
# The extraction scripts and Earth Engine downloaders reproduce all of it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/data/
/hf_cache/
/models/
/clay/
/embeddings/
*.parquet
*.parquet.bak
*.ckpt
*.pt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Superseded runs. Every analysis reported in the paper uses joint patch-
# timestep pooling; these directories are the earlier two-stage or
# Random-Forest versions, and the 2,180 cohort that preceded the matched 2,076.
# Retained on disk, excluded from the published repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
outputs/loyo_covered/
outputs/loyo_covered_ridge/
outputs/loso_all_encoders_covered/
outputs/climate_fusion_covered/
outputs/cohort_2180/
outputs/outputs/
outputs/results/
/legacy/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Per-run artefacts that are large or regenerable. Summaries, contracts and
# result files are kept; per-county predictions and per-seed run dumps are not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
outputs/**/predictions.csv
outputs/temporal_ablation_covered/*/runs/
outputs/**/best.pt
outputs/**/normalization.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Machine-specific and generated
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
configs/local.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
*.out
*.err
core.*

# Stray 4-byte scratch files left at the repository root by an editor or tool.
# Matched by shape -- eight lowercase alphanumerics, no extension -- rather than
# by name, so new ones are caught too. LICENSE and README.md are unaffected.
/[a-z0-9][a-z0-9][a-z0-9][a-z0-9][a-z0-9][a-z0-9][a-z0-9][a-z0-9]

/cohort_covered/
/alphaearth.parquet.provenance.json

# Superseded by the manuscript's own appendix, which is authoritative.
APPENDIX_REPRODUCIBILITY.tex
EXPERIMENTAL_SETUP.md
VALIDATION_REVIEW.md
SUPERVISED_MODELS.md
